,"created_at":"2020-12-16T16:30:52Z","updated_at":"2020-12-16T16:30:52Z","body":"Crash 1 should go away if you upgrade to 2.12 as we now silence the unexpected error from this case, but the root cause it uncertain: it seems we think an ad isn't playing when the IMA SDK notifies `stopAd`.\r\n\r\nFor crash 2 I'm making a fix to turn this unexpected case into a warning, which will go into the next release.\r\n\r\nThanks for reporting these issues. If you have any statistics on the relative frequency of the errors it would be helpful if you could share that information so we can decide whether it's worth digging into the causes (as opposed to just suppressing the errors).","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/746587748/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4120646317,"node_id":"MDE0OlVubGFiZWxlZEV2ZW50NDEyMDY0N